  rcases lt_or_ge x5 x0 with hlt | hle
  · rcases hc x5 x4 x3 x2 x1 x0 h5 h4 h3 h2 h1 h0 with h | h
    · rw [← G_rev]; exact h
    · exact absurd h (not_lt.mpr hlt.le)
  · rcases hc x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 h5 with h | h
